From: conda-forge natten-feedstock
Subject: [PATCH] Port the Blackwell FMHA/FNA MMA helpers to CUTLASS >= 4.5

NATTEN 0.21.7 vendors CUTLASS 4.3.5, where cute::SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS is a
plain tag type and its parameters are carried by MMA_Traits:

    MMA_Traits<SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS, a_type, b_type, c_type,
               C<M>, C<N>, integral_constant<Major, a_major>, ...>

CUTLASS 4.5 turned the op itself into a class template and moved the
parameters into it, so MMA_Traits takes a single argument:

    template <class a_type, class b_type, class c_type, int M, int N,
              UMMA::Major a_major, UMMA::Major b_major,
              UMMA::ScaleIn a_neg, UMMA::ScaleIn b_neg>
    struct SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS;

The old spelling no longer names a type, so to_tiled_mma_sm100_ts() fails to
compile against any CUTLASS >= 4.5 with:

    error: argument list for class template "cute::SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS"
           is missing

Rewrite the F8F6F4 overload in the same shape the F16BF16 overload directly
below it already uses -- match on MMA_Atom<Op<params...>, TAs...> rather than
MMA_Atom<MMA_Traits<Tag, params...>, TAs...> -- which is valid in both
layouts of the surrounding code and keeps the two overloads consistent.

This is needed because conda-forge builds against the packaged CUTLASS
(4.7.1) rather than the vendored copy.

diff --git a/csrc/include/natten/cuda/fmha_blackwell/collective/fmha_common.hpp b/csrc/include/natten/cuda/fmha_blackwell/collective/fmha_common.hpp
index 6c96030..eaa6652 100644
--- a/csrc/include/natten/cuda/fmha_blackwell/collective/fmha_common.hpp
+++ b/csrc/include/natten/cuda/fmha_blackwell/collective/fmha_common.hpp
@@ -95,22 +95,21 @@ template <
 CUTE_HOST_DEVICE constexpr auto to_tiled_mma_sm100_ts(
     TiledMMA<
         MMA_Atom<
-            MMA_Traits<
-                SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS,
+            SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS<
                 a_type,
                 b_type,
                 c_type,
-                cute::C<M>,
-                cute::C<N>,
-                cute::integral_constant<UMMA::Major, a_major>,
-                cute::integral_constant<UMMA::Major, b_major>,
-                cute::integral_constant<UMMA::ScaleIn, a_neg>,
-                cute::integral_constant<UMMA::ScaleIn, b_neg>>,
+                M,
+                N,
+                a_major,
+                b_major,
+                a_neg,
+                b_neg>,
             TAs...>,
         TMs...>) {
   return TiledMMA<
       MMA_Atom<
-          MMA_Traits<SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_TS<
+          SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_TS<
               a_type,
               b_type,
               c_type,
@@ -120,7 +119,7 @@ CUTE_HOST_DEVICE constexpr auto to_tiled_mma_sm100_ts(
               b_major,
               a_neg,
               b_neg,
-              UMMA::Saturate::False>>,
+              UMMA::Saturate::False>,
           TAs...>,
       TMs...>{};
 }
